                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Let's start with this, I am an avid RL Disc Golfer.\n\nI've been waiting for the announcement of a VR Disc Golf game since I bought my VIVE. I am happy to report, that this is a very good step in the correct direction. The physics are pretty much right there. There are 4 different \"discs\" to choose from to help you with your shots. The courses are all \"digital\" and are pretty challenging. Sound and Music are also on point.\n\nIf you actually play Disc Golf, it's going to take a bit of getting used to. Took me about 2 full rounds of 18 before I started to understand how to change my play to fit the game. The disc is about 6\" farther out that you normally throw so you have to adjust to that. Once you get that down, I was shooting Par in no time.\n\nI can't wait for them to add \"Leagues\" and Multiplayer in the near future. This is definately going to be a game for the Disc Golfer and the non-Disc Golfer. Great development team and a very promising future.",
